cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Decomposition Ensembles for Bitcoin Price Forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Data, code and results supporting the manuscript "Decomposition Ensembles for
  Bitcoin Price Forecasting", submitted to PeerJ Computer Science. The study
  couples STL and robust STL decomposition of daily Bitcoin prices with deep
  component learners (TCN, N-BEATS, GRU) and validation-guided forecast
  combination, evaluated at horizons of 1, 7, 14 and 28 days.
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/HOAHCE/Decomposition-Ensembles-for-Bitcoin-Price-Forecasting"
keywords:
  - Bitcoin
  - time series forecasting
  - STL decomposition
  - deep ensembles
  - TCN
  - N-BEATS
  - GRU
  - model confidence set
